      "cooked": "<p>Let’s get stealthy</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-326-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-266-267-stealth-suit-bunker\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-326-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-266-267-stealth-suit-bunker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-326-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-266-267-stealth-suit-bunker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #326 - Writers’ Room: Mystery Comics Vol. 2 #266...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Let's get sneaky!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:56:47 We thought knew a lot about this story going into it, but clearly not as much as we thought! Listen as we discover what we don't know, fill in the gaps, and come up with a story that we're quite proud...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b0bc8c3b3032040f7060784f2a8d6dc07a1ab85f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b0bc8c3b3032040f7060784f2a8d6dc07a1ab85f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b0bc8c3b3032040f7060784f2a8d6dc07a1ab85f_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pdtZMJVexQTNvXu9bwE36La57Ur\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b0bc8c